"TETRIS for B8Script. a d move, w rotate, s down, space drops, q quits.";
"Real time: each frame asks ? for a key (it listens about 1 ms), and gravity counts frames.";

"Variables";
"  w  the well: 12 x 21 bytes (0 empty, 1 block, 2 wall)";
"  t  28 shapes: 7 pieces x 4 turns, each a 16-bit mask of a 4 x 4 box";
"  p o x y  piece, turn, column, row     e f g  a position to try";
"  n  frame counter   s  frames per row   l  lines   b  level (every 10 lines)";
"  d  game over   c  key";
"  m v k z  used by the shape loops   i j u  scratch   a  string to draw";

"Routines";
[R r@75*74+:r! 256/%;255& %/;]
[K0 1(;r@1+r!1?:0=)]
[L13'10']

"C: row column -- move the cursor";
[C %"/[["$ #";"$ #"H"$]

"X: -- flag  does piece p, turn g, fit at e,f? true = it hits something";
[X 0z! p@4*g@+2*t@+@ m! 1v! 0k! 1( m@v@&( f@k@4/%;+12* e@+ k@4/;+ w@+, ( 1z! 0) 0)
   v@2*v! k@1+:k! 16<) z@]

"Q: string -- draw the piece's four cells with that 2-character string";
[Q a! p@4*o@+2*t@+@ m! 1v! 0k! 1( m@v@&( y@k@4/%;+1+ x@k@4/;+2*1+ C a@$ 0)
   v@2*v! k@1+:k! 16<)]

"T: -- flag  move to e,f,g if it fits";
[T X0=:( e@x! f@y! g@o! 0)]

"U: -- flag  erase, try the move, draw again";
[U " ."Q T "[]"Q]

"P: lock the piece into the well";
[P p@4*o@+2*t@+@ m! 1v! 0k! 1( m@v@&( 1 y@k@4/%;+12* x@+ k@4/;+ w@+. 0)
   v@2*v! k@1+:k! 16<)]

"F: -- flag  is row j full?";
[F -1z! 1i! 1( j@12*i@+w@+,0=( 0z! 0) i@1+:i! 11<) z@]

"H: drop every row above j down by one";
[H 1( 1i! 1( j@1- 12*i@+w@+, j@12*i@+w@+. i@1+:i! 11<) j@1-:j! 0>)
   1i! 1( 0i@w@+. i@1+:i! 11<)]

"Z: clear full rows";
[Z 19u! 1( u@j! F:( u@j! H l@1+l! 0)~( u@1-u! 0) u@0>)]

"D: draw the well and the score";
[D "/[[H"$ 0j! 1( 0i! 1( j@12*i@+w@+, 2* " .[]##"+ :,' 1+,' i@1+:i! 12<) L j@1+:j! 21<)
   2 30C "Level "$ b@# 3 30C "Lines "$ l@# 5 30C "a d move   w rotate"$ 6 30C "s down     space drop"$ 7 30C "q quit"$]

"N: -- flag  a new piece at the top; true if it doesn't fit (game over)";
[N 7R p! 0o! 4x! 0y! x@e! y@f! o@g! X]

"G: gravity: one row down, or lock, clear lines and start a new piece";
"   Speed: 1140 frames a row at level 0 (about 1.5 s), 95 fewer each level, never under 95";
[G x@e! y@1+f! o@g! U 0=( P Z l@10/%;b! 1140 b@95*- s! s@95<( 95s! 0) D N( 1d! 0) "[]"Q 0)]

"Y: act on the key in c";
[Y c@97=( x@1-e! y@f! o@g! U; 0) c@100=( x@1+e! y@f! o@g! U; 0)
   c@119=( x@e! y@f! o@1+3&g! U; 0) c@115=( G 0)
   c@32=( 1( x@e! y@1+f! o@g! U ) G 0) c@113=( 1d! 0)]

"Main program";
252_w! 56_t!
240 17476 240 17476  102 102 102 102  39 562 114 610  54 561 54 561
99 306 99 306  113 550 1136 802  116 1570 368 547
27i! 1( i@2*t@+! i@1-:i! -1>)

"/[[2J/[[H"$ "TETRIS"$ L L "a d move, w rotate, s down, space drops, q quits."$ L "Press a key."$ L K;

1( 0i! 1( i@12/; x! i@12/%; y! 0 x@0= x@11=| y@20=|( ; 2 0) i@w@+. i@1+:i! 252<)
   "/[[2J"$ 0l! 0b! 0d! 0n! 1140s! D N; "[]"Q
   1( 1? c! c@( Y 0) n@1+:n! s@>( 0n! G 0) d@0=)
   23 1C "GAME OVER. Lines: "$ l@# "   Play again? (y//n) "$ K 121= )
L
